{"content":{"hero":{"badge":"Premier Digital Agency • Dedicated Specialized Teams","headline":"We Turn Your Vision Into Digital Growth.","subheadline":"From powerful websites to creative marketing strategies, GrowthNova brings specialised teams together to help businesses build, grow, and succeed in the digital world.","primaryCtaText":"Let's Work Together","secondaryCtaText":"Explore Our Work"},"about":{"tagline":"Your Vision. Our Strategy. Your Growth.","story":"GrowthNova was established with a singular objective: to bridge the gap between creative ambition and tangible business expansion. Rather than offering one-size-fits-all freelance services, GrowthNova operates as a cohesive digital agency composed of five dedicated, cross-functional teams spanning engineering, brand identity, social acceleration, video storytelling, and search optimisation.","vision":"To become the benchmark digital transformation partner for forward-thinking startups, growing brands, and established organizations worldwide by delivering measurable, compounding digital growth.","mission":"To empower brands through strategic design, high-performance web development, and impact-driven marketing campaigns, turning ambitious visions into dominant digital presences.","philosophy":"Strategy first, execution with precision, and relentless focus on client ROI. We believe true digital success requires coordinated collaboration between specialized disciplines.","approach":"Our 4-stage delivery framework: 1. Deep Discovery & Strategy, 2. Collaborative Design & Prototyping, 3. Agile Technical & Creative Execution, 4. Launch, Measurement & Continuous Scale."},"stats":[{"label":"Specialised Teams","value":"5","description":"Cross-functional creative & technical pods"},{"label":"Client Satisfaction","value":"99%","description":"Transparent collaboration & quality delivery"},{"label":"Digital Disciplines","value":"25+","description":"End-to-end full service agency capabilities"},{"label":"Active Projects Handled","value":"50+","description":"Startups, businesses & international clients"}],"faqs":[{"question":"How is GrowthNova structured differently from individual freelancers?","answer":"GrowthNova is an integrated digital agency with dedicated specialized pods: Web Development, Digital Marketing, Creative Design, Video Production, and SEO. Every project is steered by dedicated specialists working in synergy rather than a solo generalist.","category":"Agency"},{"question":"How do you preserve client confidentiality and privacy?","answer":"We adhere to rigorous data privacy standards. Direct communication is handled via our private encrypted website messaging system and official channels without exposing sensitive private contact vectors.","category":"Communication"},{"question":"Can you work with both local businesses and international clients?","answer":"Yes. Our remote-first, collaborative infrastructure allows us to serve local enterprises, national businesses, and international startups across time zones.","category":"Services"},{"question":"How do we get started with a project?","answer":"You can submit a project enquiry through our Work With Us page, use our interactive Project Cost Estimator, or schedule a strategy consultation. Our team will review your requirements and respond within 24 hours.","category":"Onboarding"}],"pricingRules":{"baseRate":25000,"complexityMultiplier":{"standard":1,"advanced":1.6,"enterprise":2.5},"scaleMultiplier":{"startup":1,"growing":1.4,"established":2.2},"featurePrice":4000,"currency":"INR"}}}